entry .urlInterfaces
  info
      - the URL types a URL-producing API may return, each a given to import by name
      + les types d'URL que peut renvoyer une API produisant des URL, chacun un given à importer par
      + son nom
  detail
      - A method bounded `[url: Instantiable across Urls from Text]` names no concrete URL type,
      - so the instance is chosen by importing one of these by name.
